        <p>{item.body}</p>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <p class="note-line">
    Cross-check hostel funding claims against the <a href="https://www.ugc.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">UGC's official site</a> and city-level safety infrastructure against your state's women's helpline (dial 112) before assuming either is in place.
  </p>

  <h2 id="family">Handling family pressure without turning it into a fight</h2>

  <p>
    Family involvement in career decisions is not unique to India, but the intensity and the specific pressure points — marriage timing, safety, "suitability" — are worth naming directly instead of avoiding.
  </p>

  <div class="comparison-grid">
    {familyCards.map((item) => (
